		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Nature itself shaped into a gargantuan old, wrinkled man bearing a crooked staff. Guardian of hills and glades. Most powerful, revered kami.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 staff (near) +4 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Nature Manifest</strong>. Hinder or help those in its domain, such as doubling or halving travel time, or providing food or shelter.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ward</strong>. Kami protects a lake, mountain, or other area of nature. Can merge into warded area and observe everything occurring there.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
